        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">GEBVRES GE|RIHTE . Gebur gerihta syn mislice . gehwar hy syn hefige . gehwar eac mederne .</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">The duty of the peasant The duties of the peasant are diverse, in some places they might be heavier, elsewhere [more] moderate.</ab>
